# Phase Dependency Map

## Phase-Level Dependencies

### Phase Dependency Graph

```
Phase 0 (Commission & Scoping)
     │
     ├── Hard dependency: None (entry point)
     └── Parallel: None

     ↓ (hard)

Phase 1 (Plugin Concept & Sound Identity)
     │
     ├── Hard dependency: Phase 0 (SPEC.md, constraints, success criteria)
     └── Parallel: None (requires creative decisions from Phase 0)

     ↓ (hard)

Phase 2 (Architecture & Task Breakdown)
     │
     ├── Hard dependency: Phase 1 (sound identity, creative direction)
     └── Parallel: None (requires creative decisions to design)

     ↓ (hard)

Phase 3 (Project Setup & Test Framework)
     │
     ├── Hard dependency: Phase 2 (architecture, task list)
     └── Parallel: None (requires architecture to set up)

     ↓ (hard)

Phase 4 (DSP Implementation)
     │
     ├── Hard dependency: Phase 3 (build system, tests)
     ├── Soft dependency: Sound Design KB (bridge queries)
     └── Parallel: Phase 5 preparation (state design)

     ↓ (hard)

Phase 5 (State Management)
     │
     ├── Hard dependency: Phase 4 (DSP modules)
     └── Parallel: None (requires parameter layout from DSP)

     ↓ (hard)

Phase 6 (Integration)
     │
     ├── Hard dependency: Phase 5 (state management)
     └── Parallel: None (requires all components)

     ↓ (hard)

Phase 7 (GUI Design)
     │
     ├── Hard dependency: Phase 6 (integrated plugin)
     ├── Soft dependency: UI/UX KB
     └── Parallel: None (requires parameter layout)

     ↓ (hard)

Phase 8 (Validation & Testing)
     │
     ├── Hard dependency: Phase 7 (complete plugin)
     └── Parallel: None (requires GUI for full testing)

     ↓ (hard)

Phase 9 (DAW Testing)
     │
     ├── Hard dependency: Phase 8 (validated plugin)
     └── Parallel: None (human-only testing)

     ↓ (hard)

Phase 10 (Licensing Integration)
     │
     ├── Hard dependency: Phase 9 (tested plugin)
     ├── Soft dependency: Commercial KB (licensing options)
     └── Parallel: Phase 11 preparation (marketplace research)

     ↓ (hard)

Phase 11 (Marketplace Preparation)
     │
     ├── Hard dependency: Phase 10 (licensed plugin)
     ├── Soft dependency: Commercial KB (marketplace requirements)
     └── Parallel: Phase 12 preparation (marketing content)

     ↓ (hard)

Phase 12 (Marketing Launch Preparation)
     │
     ├── Hard dependency: Phase 11 (marketplace ready)
     └── Parallel: None (requires release date)

     ↓ (hard)

Phase 13 (Release & Distribution)
     │
     ├── Hard dependency: Phase 12 (marketing ready)
     └── Parallel: None (go/no-go decision)

     ↓ (hard)

Phase 14 (Post-Launch Operations)
     │
     ├── Hard dependency: Phase 13 (released product)
     └── Parallel: None (requires customer feedback)

     ↓ (hard)

Phase 15 (Continuous Improvement)
     │
     ├── Hard dependency: Phase 14 (support running)
     └── Parallel: None (requires sales data)

     ↓ (hard)

Phase 16 (KB Maintenance)
     │
     ├── Hard dependency: Phases 0-15 (lessons learned)
     └── Parallel: None (final phase)
```

