## Task-Level Dependencies Within Phases

### Phase 0 (Commission & Scoping)
```
[Coordinator] — Establish configuration
     ↓
[Coordinator] — Create project knowledge base folder
     ↓
[Stakeholder] — Define purpose, scope, constraints, success criteria (parallel)
     ↓
[Stakeholder] — Classify domain complexity
     ↓
[Coordinator] — Read and acknowledge all phases
     ↓
[Coordinator] — Plan session boundaries
     ↓
[Coordinator] — Phase gate
```

### Phase 4 (DSP Implementation)
```
[AI] — Read all existing source files
     ↓
[AI] — Design class architecture
     ↓
[AI] — Specify DSP algorithms with math
     ↓
[Human] — Approve DSP architecture
     ↓
[AI] — Implement DSP modules (parallel per module)
     ↓
[AI] — Integrate modules
     ↓
[AI] — Implement parameter smoothing
     ↓
[AI] — Self-review for audio thread safety
     ↓
[Coordinator] — Phase gate
```

### Phase 9 (DAW Testing) — Human-Only
```
[Human] — Load plugin in REAPER
     ↓
[Human] — Test basic functionality
     ↓
[Human] — Test parameter ranges
     ↓
[Human] — Test preset save/load
     ↓
[Human] — Listen for audio issues
     ↓
[Human] — Report findings
     ↓
[Coordinator] — Phase gate
```

