## Parallel Execution Opportunities

| Phase Pair | Parallel? | Notes |
|------------|-----------|-------|
| Phase 0 & Phase 1 | No | Phase 1 needs Phase 0 decisions |
| Phase 4 & Phase 5 preparation | Partial | DSP must complete before State implementation |
| Phase 10 & Phase 11 prep | Yes | Licensing integration and marketplace research can overlap |
| Phase 11 & Phase 12 prep | Yes | Marketplace prep and marketing content can overlap |

